{"reviews":[{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-0","r":2.0,"t":"Ruined bedding","x":"I purchased for my daughter.  She has no problem wearing it. It's soft and comfortable.  It stays on all night long. However the black floral one left a nasty stain all over her sheets and pillowcase.  I washed it by hand before she wore it too. I hope the stain comes out because these are the best sheets! Very disappointing.","h":47,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-1","r":3.0,"t":"Buyer beware!","x":"This product is deceiving. Anyone who has curly hair knows that you need the satin to be on the inside of the cap in order for it to actually protect your hair from getting frizzy. These sleeping caps do not have satin on the inside as you can see in the reverse photo so you would have to flip them inside out in order to have them protect your curls properly. While they are inexpensive, this is also the reason WHY they are inexpensive as they do not contain satin on the inside of the cap as the ","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-2","r":2.0,"t":"Cute; could be improved.","x":"I have to use the cap inside out to meet the purpose since only one side (outside) is silky. Cap\u2019s elastic rides up rubbing on the back of the hair. Cute looking hair caps (also holds color during wash) if you are buying for running errands but not made with hair care/taming frizz or dryness coming from sleeping on cotton pillows in mind. The seller is trying to hide my review.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-3","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty but slip off head","x":"I want to use these to keep my hair out of my face at night but they need some security straps to keep them on.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-4","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty good for price, but watch out for stains!","x":"I got these bonnets to protect my curls while I sleep. They stay on well, the fit is good and the wide elastic band is great. Downside: have to reverse them so the satiny side is on the inside, or it defeats the purpose. Warning: the black one keeps staining my white sheets! (It\u2019s been washed several times) Going to try hot water soak with detergent, see if that helps. \ud83e\udd37\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Mostly good product for the price. First time using sleep bonnets.","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-5","r":4.0,"t":"THIS IS IT!","x":"I HAVE TO WEAR A CPAP HEADGEAR WHEN I BED AT NIGHT.  MY LONG WAVY HAIR WAS ALWAYS GETTING KNOTTED UP IN IT, AND PULLING MY HAIR.  REMEMBERED THE OLD DAYS WHEN MY MOTHER WORE A SLEEP CAP, TO KEEP EVERY HAIR OF HERS IN PLACE.  TRIED THESE.  THEY ARE GREAT!  KEEPS MY HAIR IN ONE PLACE, AND THE HEADGEAR DOESN'T SHIFT AROUND ON ME WHEN I SLEEP. P.S.....MY HUSBAND THINK I LOOK CUTE IN THEM.  LOL.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love these","x":"I was looking for a bonnet that would securely stay on my head through the night. These do not move and do not stretch even after a few washes. This is a double-edged sword because sometimes I find it a bit too tight or scratchy (my skin is sensitive)... All-in-all, worth it and I will probably purchase it again.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-7","r":5.0,"t":"The Band will not hurt your head","x":"What I like about these is that the band isn't too tight. It grabs enough but to to where you will get a headache.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-8","r":4.0,"t":"Stays on fine, wish the headband was a bit softer","x":"Overall, great for the price. I personally don't need four bonnets but that's just me. The designs are very cute and it stays on while I am sleeping. I only wish the headband was a bit softer. I try to keep it on my forehead because I don't want constant friction on my hairline to give me breakage. Something a liiiittle smoother would have been nice, but overall, still a good product.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-9","r":1.0,"t":"NOT SATIN","x":"It says made of of satin and ITS NOT ITS POLYESTER false advertisement","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-10","r":5.0,"t":"They hold your hair nicely.","x":"They were perfect. I love that they stay on your head all night.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-11","r":5.0,"t":"Nice and big.","x":"Nice sleep bonnet. Wide band is comfortable and stretchy. Cap is big enough for my fro, band is tight enough that it doesn't slide off during the night...but not so tight that it gives you a headache.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love them!","x":"Just what we needed, ordered for my daughters and I! We love them cute and they stay on! Even gave my mom one and she wears it faithfully lol.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-13","r":5.0,"t":"Stayed on ALL night","x":"Washed up well and stayed on ALL thru the night!! Great deal","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-14","r":5.0,"t":"It's the best purchase I've made!!","x":"The price is not bad for 4 bonnet caps. I loved the colors and you won't have any issues about it. It protects your hair and the bonnet stays on all night which is very the best. Don't thick too hard and if you need it or you're thinking of buying one then, buy it because you won't regret it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-15","r":5.0,"t":"Does not itch","x":"My hair sheds a lot so this sleeping cap keeps my hair intact without it being all over my pillow and bed which is great, it is also very soft, but it slides off a bit, it does stretch a bit and it is not thick it is very thin which is good because I get very hot.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-16","r":1.0,"t":"Cuff rolls up","x":"I don't know whya replacement order showed up today as I do not want a replacement I will be sending both sets of orders of this cap back to you","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-17","r":5.0,"t":"Holds well to head without the tightness or lines.","x":"Holds well to head without being too tight. It also fits braids.  I was surprised at how much it holds. It also stays on all night.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-18","r":5.0,"t":"It's helps for sleep","x":"Its really nice nd beautiful I'm happy when I go to bed","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-19","r":5.0,"t":"Good fit","x":"I really love the caps they are so comfortable it\u2019s hard to find a fit like these. I gave my daughter and granddaughter one they love them I ordered some more so pleased","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-20","r":2.0,"t":"Not real Satin","x":"Not Satin. Polyester and feels odd. The fit is ok,  slightly tight around the band but i like that. Wooosh the material was better.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-21","r":5.0,"t":"You will not regret buying these caps","x":"I could not be happier with these caps. They fit perfectly and really protect my hair. I love the patterns.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-22","r":5.0,"t":"Worth the money","x":"Love them just one of them was a little to tight gave me a headache until I washed it then I was ok","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not satin","x":"Super disappointed that something advertised as 100% Satin is actually 100% polyester.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07RRVNQSV-24","r":5.0,"t":"Stays on all night","x":"These are worth every penny.  1st cap in a long time that stayed on all night ....","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the bonnets stay securely on the head all night without sliding off.","cites":[1,5,7,9,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the satin/silky side is on the outside, so the cap must be worn inside out to protect hair.","cites":[2,3,5]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the black bonnet stains sheets and pillowcases.","cites":[1,5]},{"text":"Reviewers describe the wide elastic band as comfortable and not too tight, though a few find it scratchy or too tight.","cites":[5,7,8,9,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers question the material, saying it is polyester rather than satin.","cites":[10]}]},"qa":[]}